---
// Homepage explainer: make good vs strip out vs defit. Links through to the full blog comparison.
const terms = [
  {
    name: "Make good",
    tag: "The obligation and the result",
    body: "Returning the space to the condition your lease requires, including repairs and cleaning, with the landlord signing it off at handover.",
  },
  {
    name: "Strip out",
    tag: "The removal work",
    body: "Taking out partitions, ceilings, flooring, cabling and joinery. It is one stage of a make good, and it is also done before a refurbishment or new fitout.",
  },
  {
    name: "Defit",
    tag: "Also written de-fit",
    body: "Removing the tenant's fitout and equipment back to a shell. Often used to mean the same as strip out, so always check what a quote actually includes.",
  },
];
---

<section class="py-16 md:py-20 border-t border-border">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-5xl">
    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4 text-center">
      Make Good, Strip Out or Defit: <span class="text-primary">What's the Difference?</span>
    </h2>
    <p class="text-lg text-muted-foreground text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-10">
      These terms get used interchangeably when quoting, which is how two quotes for the same tenancy end up far apart. Here is how we use them.
    </p>

    <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
      {terms.map((term) => (
        <div class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-card p-6">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-1">{term.name}</h3>
          <p class="text-sm font-medium text-primary mb-3">{term.tag}</p>
          <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">{term.body}</p>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>

    <p class="text-center text-foreground mt-8 max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
      Strip out and defit are the work. A make good is the full job, including reinstatement and landlord sign off. Always ask contractors to quote against your lease, not a generic label.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center items-center">
      <a
        href="/blog/make-good-strip-out-defit-melbourne/"
        data-track="explainer_blog"
        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center h-11 px-8 rounded-md bg-primary text-primary-foreground font-medium hover:bg-primary/90 transition-colors"
      >
        Read the full comparison
      </a>
      <a
        href="/contact/"
        data-track="explainer_quote"
        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center h-11 px-8 rounded-md border border-input bg-background font-medium hover:bg-accent hover:text-accent-foreground transition-colors"
      >
        Get a quote against your lease
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
